# Utilvia design system (Claude editorial)

Source of truth: cream + coral + dark. Warm humanist AI aesthetic — not cool blue SaaS.

## Color

- Canvas `#faf9f5`, ink `#141413`, body `#3d3d3a`
- Coral primary `#cc785c`, active `#a9583e`
- Dark surfaces `#181715` / `#252320` / `#1f1e1b`
- Amber `#e8a55a` (secondary warmth), teal `#5db8a6` (sparingly)
- On dark: `#faf9f5` / `#a09d96`
- Do not introduce purple, saturated blue, cyan, or neon green

## Type

- Display: Newsreader (Google Fonts), weight **600**, tight negative tracking. Hero 64px / 1.05 / -1.5px; mobile 32px. Italic coral accents allowed for emphasis.
- Body/UI: Inter (StyreneB stand-in), 16px / 400 / 1.55; nav 14px / 500 / 1.4
- Buttons: Inter 14px / 500, height 40px, padding 12×20, radius 8px

## Hero atmosphere

- Light cream hero (`#faf9f5`), not dark charcoal
- Soft mesh at the bottom: peach `#f4d0c5` left, lavender `#d6cbec` right, fading up into cream
- Centered geodesic globe: coral wireframe + coral particles on cream (no neon green)
- Slow CSS transforms / canvas rotate; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Content z-20, globe z-1, gradients z-0, vignette z-1, `pointer-events: none`
- Headline/body stay ink on cream for contrast
